⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
233 calories 23g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins/toppings included)

Shamrock Oreo McFlurry Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Full recipe book (180+ flavors) in bio!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40-45g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 5g (1 tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
– ⅛ tsp peppermint extract
- 1 drop green food coloring (optional)
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 5 Oreo Thins (cream removed)
233 cal 29g C, 2g F, 23g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if very powdery
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the Oreos
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

